Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 08:16:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] shell-app: Match the starting workspace against the
 global index

app->started_on_workspace comes from the startup sequence, which mutter
fills in from the global workspace list, and it is handed back to
meta_window_change_workspace_by_index(). The comparison in
shell_app_is_on_workspace() has to count the same workspaces, or an app
starting on a workspace of a secondary monitor is reported as being on a
workspace of the first one.
